* {{audio|en|en-us-acclimatization.ogg|a=US}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# The act of acclimatizing; the process of [[inuring]] to a new climate, or the state of being so [[inure]]d.
# {{lb|en|biology}} The [[climatic]] adaptation of an [[organism]] that has been moved to a new environment.

